 "description": "The Luna T7 Cryptographic Module from Thales Trusted Cyber Technologies (TCT) is a high-assurance, tamper-resistant Hardware Security Module (HSM) which secures sensitive data and critical applications by storing, protecting and managing cryptographic keys. It provides end users with industry-leading security and performance, an ability to generate quantum enhanced keys, and can quickly be embedded directly into servers and security appliances for FIPS 140-2 validated key security. Thales TCT's Lluna HSMs are designed, developed, manufactured, sold, and supported in the United States.",
